      "pao" : {
        "person" : "A bishop in full robes",
        "action" : "raising his hands three times to bless the ground and three times being turned back",
        "object" : "the steel ribbon of Infinity looping above him",
        "notes" : "“But, in a larger sense, we can not dedicate—we can not consecrate—we can not hallow—this ground.” A bishop at the museum's Mall entrance raises his hands three times, to dedicate, to consecrate, to hallow the ground, and three times his blessing is swallowed by the endless steel ribbon of the Infinity sculpture above him, something larger than any blessing of his."
