        "action" : "sweeping the speeches out of the doors while a vast canvas of the soldiers goes up behind him",
        "object" : "a painting of what they did, which never fades",
        "notes" : "“The world will little note, nor long remember what we say here, but it can never forget what they did here.” A guard at the top of the gallery's Mall steps sweeps the speakers' words out of the doors like litter, while behind him a vast canvas of the soldiers' charge is hung in the rotunda to stay there for ever."
